    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A hidden object roleplaying game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeking Adventure is a hidden object game with a dash of roleplaying and dice rolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/d1dc81154a5e7c166617a3e16b8e82a7.poster.avif?t=1753045908\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/d1dc81154a5e7c166617a3e16b8e82a7.webm?t=1753045908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/d1dc81154a5e7c166617a3e16b8e82a7.mp4?t=1753045908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Search dozens of hand designed levels for secret loot and hidden objects.\u00a0Solve puzzles, complete quests and unlock new levels in this laid back RPG about finding stuff.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/c0ec3c9192e8adb494b09aa158c641d0.poster.avif?t=1753045908\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/c0ec3c9192e8adb494b09aa158c641d0.webm?t=1753045908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/c0ec3c9192e8adb494b09aa158c641d0.mp4?t=1753045908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer challenges by rolling dice based on your equipped gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/72c551e68f25061d5802c912d7711bee.poster.avif?t=1753045908\" width=800 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/72c551e68f25061d5802c912d7711bee.webm?t=1753045908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/72c551e68f25061d5802c912d7711bee.mp4?t=1753045908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attribute based stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory and equipment system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests to find loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges by rolling dice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip better gear to improve your dice rolls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large open world filled with individual hand designed levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check off objects in each level to track your completion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A hidden object roleplaying game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeking Adventure is a hidden object game with a dash of roleplaying and dice rolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/d1dc81154a5e7c166617a3e16b8e82a7.poster.avif?t=1753045908\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/d1dc81154a5e7c166617a3e16b8e82a7.webm?t=1753045908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/d1dc81154a5e7c166617a3e16b8e82a7.mp4?t=1753045908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Search dozens of hand designed levels for secret loot and hidden objects.\u00a0Solve puzzles, complete quests and unlock new levels in this laid back RPG about finding stuff.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/c0ec3c9192e8adb494b09aa158c641d0.poster.avif?t=1753045908\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/c0ec3c9192e8adb494b09aa158c641d0.webm?t=1753045908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/c0ec3c9192e8adb494b09aa158c641d0.mp4?t=1753045908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer challenges by rolling dice based on your equipped gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/72c551e68f25061d5802c912d7711bee.poster.avif?t=1753045908\" width=800 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/72c551e68f25061d5802c912d7711bee.webm?t=1753045908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436560/extras/72c551e68f25061d5802c912d7711bee.mp4?t=1753045908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attribute based stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory and equipment system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests to find loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges by rolling dice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip better gear to improve your dice rolls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large open world filled with individual hand designed levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check off objects in each level to track your completion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Seeking Adventure is more than your average hidden object game. Click things, loot stuff, and roll dice in this cozy fantasy RPG where your discoveries matter.",
